    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world where every click counts! Your goal? Accumulate kibble to unlock new improvements and conquer the world of felines. But be careful, management is key: invest strategically to maximize your kibbles per second (CPS) and participate in dynamic mini-games to boost your production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Varied mini-games: Test your reflexes and strategy with fun challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Endless Upgrades: Unlock factories, interstellar convoys, and even kibble black holes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Immersive atmosphere: A \u201cCat Night\u201d mode with stars and animations to change the atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are a cat lover, a fan of incremental games or simply curious, CroquettesClicker\u00a0is for you. Be careful, it can cause a crunchy feline addiction!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world where every click counts! Your goal? Accumulate kibble to unlock new improvements and conquer the world of felines. But be careful, management is key: invest strategically to maximize your kibbles per second (CPS) and participate in dynamic mini-games to boost your production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Varied mini-games: Test your reflexes and strategy with fun challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Endless Upgrades: Unlock factories, interstellar convoys, and even kibble black holes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Immersive atmosphere: A \u201cCat Night\u201d mode with stars and animations to change the atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are a cat lover, a fan of incremental games or simply curious, CroquettesClicker\u00a0is for you. Be careful, it can cause a crunchy feline addiction!</p>",
    "short_description": "An incremental game based on kibble and cats! Collect, upgrade and manage your kibble to reach undreamt-of heights. Can you become the ultimate kibble master?",
